1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:02,770
Hop onto ottoman.

2
00:00:02,776 --> 00:00:06,716
(Raj:)Don't do that in socks,
I almost broke my neck.

3
00:00:06,714 --> 00:00:08,714
(Howard:)Then simply sit,

4
00:00:08,716 --> 00:00:11,116
(Howard:)spin, stand,

5
00:00:11,118 --> 00:00:13,318
(Howard:)stretch...

6
00:00:16,991 --> 00:00:19,121
Maybe unloosen your pants.

7
00:00:20,461 --> 00:00:22,691
And... step,

8
00:00:22,696 --> 00:00:24,496
(Howard:)grab, tiny pivot,

9
00:00:24,498 --> 00:00:26,628
(Howard:)pull, and you're there.

10
00:00:27,701 --> 00:00:29,531
(Howard:)Easy, peasy, mac and...

11
00:00:29,536 --> 00:00:32,036
(Howard:)You get the idea.

12
00:00:32,039 --> 00:00:34,539
(Bernadette:)You actually expect me
to do this

13
00:00:34,541 --> 00:00:36,711
(Bernadette:)while holding a baby
in the dark?

14
00:00:36,710 --> 00:00:39,380
(Raj:)Hold on...

15
00:00:45,486 --> 00:00:46,956
(Raj:)I don't think she was impressed.

16
00:00:46,954 --> 00:00:48,484
(Howard:)Bigger problems.

17
00:00:48,489 --> 00:00:51,589
(Howard:)I felt something pop.

18
00:00:53,727 --> 00:00:56,967
(Sheldon:)There's a cucumber
in my water.

19
00:00:56,964 --> 00:00:59,024
(Amy:)Uh-huh.

